gpu-residency-probe.c
gpu-residency-probe [bytes] [vram|gtt] [--resident-only | --resume-gate READY RELEASE TIMEOUT_MS]
Resume gate: <=1GiB, timeout 1..1800000ms; READY must be new, RELEASE absent and later contain this PID in ASCII. Two full GPU readbacks in one process, no eviction cycle or recreation. External evidence must establish S4.
Default: <=1GiB, 3 eviction cycles, 300s watchdog.
Resident-only: <=12GiB in <=1GiB members retained together, no pressure allocation; full GPU readback and complete-set residency/budget snapshots every64MiB. No continuous-residency claim.
